For any tubal-length $\bs{\varLambda} = (\lambda_1, \ldots, \lambda_\ell)$ it holds that 
    \begin{equation}\label{eq:ltrunc.transform.opt}
        \FNormS{\thX - \thX_{\{\bs{\varLambda}\}}} \leq \FNormS{\thX - \thY} , \quad \text{ for all } \tY \in \RR_n^{m \xx p} \text{ with } \lng_{\RR_n}(\tY) \leq \bs{\varLambda}
    \end{equation}
